[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_script")
id = "chapel_confession"
display_name = "Unsent Confession"
description = "A priest's letter to his Abbot, never sent."
category = 3
tint = Color(0.45, 0.42, 0.5, 1)
author = "Brother Edmund"
region_id = "hollowmere"
lore_text = "To the Abbot. Unsent.

I blessed the barrels myself. Three of them, Lorisian red, sealed in black wax, sent up from the castle. I felt nothing. I was pleased with myself.

On the second night I heard it in the wine. Not in the cellar, in the wine itself. A voice beneath the surface, humming a tune I half knew from our own chapel.

I locked myself in the belfry and I have not come down. The ringing of the bell drowns it out.

I think the curse travels through song. Every hymn sung on that feast night carried it to another throat.

Aleister was never in the fire. I saw the ashes. They were too light, and they were still warm the next morning. A man does not leave ash like that.

I mean to ring until the rope gives way. Forgive me the blessing -"
